Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, procps
Recommends: jwm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: Long press for right click on a touchscreen (Pivuan Audio)
 X's touchscreen drivers have no long press. This program takes the
 touchscreen and gives X a pointer instead: a tap is a left click, a moving
 finger drags with the left button (a window border too), and a finger held
 still and then lifted is a right click.
 Pivuan Audio starts it at login when a touchscreen is attached
 (/usr/lib/pivuan/long-press); Desktop Settings can turn it off.
